# The Squarespace store moved off this domain when cashhardclub.com was
# pointed at Netlify. Until shop.cashhardclub.com is connected in
# Squarespace, every store path bounces to the store's built-in address —
# this keeps all Buy buttons and previously shared product links working.
# When the shop subdomain goes live, swap the host below and redeploy.
/store-MFHja      https://shopcashhardclub.squarespace.com/store-MFHja/merch  301
/store-MFHja/*    https://shopcashhardclub.squarespace.com/store-MFHja/:splat 301
/cart             https://shopcashhardclub.squarespace.com/cart               301
/cart/*           https://shopcashhardclub.squarespace.com/cart/:splat        301
/checkout         https://shopcashhardclub.squarespace.com/checkout           301
/checkout/*       https://shopcashhardclub.squarespace.com/checkout/:splat    301

# The mobile app source lives in a subdirectory of this repo and the Netlify publish
# directory is the repo root — keep the app tree and its internal docs off the public site.
# The trailing "!" forces the rule: without it Netlify serves the real file at the path
# and the rule never runs. The bare path is not matched by the splat, so it needs its own line.
/CashHardClub-App     /   404!
/CashHardClub-App/*   /   404!
